<item>
  <title>Project Heracless</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/project-heracless</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/project-heracless" hreflang="en"&gt;Project Heracless&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&amp;gt; 95%&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;decarbonization with full electrification&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Application of world-class&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;sized heat pumps&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Consultancy services as part of an integrated project management team&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Focused on the implementation of Direct Reduced Iron Plant (DRI) and Reducing Electrical Furnace (REF) technology at the facility&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Part of hydrogen-based steel production plan&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Electrical drivers on all rotating equipment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;DRI is a relatively new production technology, in which iron ores are directly reduced using natural gas or hydrogen, rather than coal. The reduced iron is then processed into hot metal in an electric furnace (REF). One major advantage of the technology is that by using green electricity and a predominant hydrogen stream, the CO2 emissions from the process are much lower than when using blast furnaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Carbon Capture &amp;amp; Utilization (CCU)&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-11/Project_heracless%20Spotlight_0.jpg.webp?itok=G2fNvH_G" width="864" height="576" alt="Project Heracless" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
